  R->>A: REQUEST · callId 1 · leg B<br/>CREDENTIAL JWT: the same bytes
  Note over A: verifies the JWT:<br/>the call runs<br/>in its session
  A-->>R: RESULT · callId 1
  R-->>C: RESULT · callId 3
  C->>R: REQUEST · callId 5 · DESTINATION 8<br/>CREDENTIAL JWT
  R-->>C: FAILURE · callId 5<br/>DESTINATION_UNREACHABLE
